{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"224621","name":"Cosmopolit","description":"A, 35-minute drive from Athens Airport and a 15-minute drive from the port of Piraeus, this neoclassical hotel offers luxurious accommodation in a historic setting. Located in the heart of Athens, 50m from a metro station, it is an excellent base for visitors to explore the local points of interest, such as the Acropolis Hill, the National theatre, the ancient district of Placa and many others. The modern elegantly decorated rooms will satisfy the needs of even the most seasoned travellers with standard features like free WiFi Internet access, LCD TV and 24-hour room service. The reception is also open 24 hours a day and the staff will be happy to provide assistance with luggage storage, car rentals and travel information. Guests can ask for advice for dining options, as the area offers a great number of taverns, restaurants and bars.","address":"MARIKAS KOTOPOULI, 7","city":"ATHENS","countryCode":"GR","postalCode":"10432","lat":37.985271985167,"lng":23.7277552555315,"stars":2,"giataCode":"400774","phone":"00302105241003","email":"info@hotel-cosmopolit.com","website":"http://www.hotel-cosmopolit.com/en-us/home.aspx","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/22/224621/224621a_hb_a_004.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/22/224621/224621a_hb_a_005_20251104_064544.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/22/224621/224621a_hb_a_006_20251104_064546.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/22/224621/224621a_hb_l_001.jpg","category":"lobby","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/22/224621/224621a_hb_l_002.jpg","category":"lobby","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/22/224621/224621a_hb_l_003.jpg","category":"lobby","order":5},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/22/2246